
### 1. Get all movies
GET http://localhost:3001/movies

### 2. Get movie by ID
GET http://localhost:3001/movies/1

### 3. Get a movie that does not exist
GET http://localhost:3001/movies/999

### 4. Create a new movie
POST http://localhost:3001/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Blade Runner",
  "director": "Ridley Scott",
  "year": 1982
}

### 5. Create an invalid movie
POST http://localhost:3001/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "director": "Nobody"
}

### 6. Update a movie (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:3001/movies/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2011
}

### 7. Create another valid movie
POST http://localhost:3001/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Arrival",
  "director": "Denis Villeneuve",
  "year": 2016
}

### 8. Create an invalid movie
POST http://localhost:3001/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "director": "Nobody"
}

### 9. Replace a movie (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:3001/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Matrix",
  "director": "The Wachowskis",
  "year": 1999
}

### 10. Invalid incomplete PUT
PUT http://localhost:3001/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Matrix"
}

### 11. Partially update a movie (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:3001/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2000
}

### 12. Filter by director
GET http://localhost:3001/movies?director=Nolan

### 13. Filter by year
GET http://localhost:3001/movies?year=2010

### 14. Sort by year
GET http://localhost:3001/movies?sortBy=year

### 15. Sort by title
GET http://localhost:3001/movies?sortBy=title

### 16. Empty PATCH test
PATCH http://localhost:3001/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 17. Delete a movie
DELETE http://localhost:3001/movies/6

### 18. Delete the same movie again
DELETE http://localhost:3001/movies/6

### 19. Unknown route
GET http://localhost:3001/does-not-exist

### 20. Check database connection
GET http://localhost:3001/health/database

### Create movie for persistence test
POST http://localhost:3001/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Persistence Test Movie",
  "director": "Test Director",
  "year": 2025
}
